# leadharbor-mcp

MCP server for the LeadHarbor APIs on RapidAPI. Lets Claude, Cursor and other MCP clients call:

| Tool | What it does |
|---|---|
| `verify_email` | Syntax, typo, disposable/role/free flags, MX, SPF/DMARC. **MX-only**: it never contacts the mailbox, so it cannot confirm an address exists or detect catch-all domains. |
| `extract_website_contacts` | Emails, phones and social links from a site's home/contact/about pages |
| `search_linkedin_jobs` / `get_linkedin_job` | Public LinkedIn job search and detail (logged-out guest endpoint; can be rate-limited by LinkedIn) |
| `search_youtube` / `get_youtube_channel` / `get_youtube_video` | YouTube search, channel uploads, video metadata |

## Setup

You need a RapidAPI key with a subscription to the LeadHarbor listings. RapidAPI handles billing; this server stores nothing.

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "leadharbor": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "leadharbor-mcp"],
      "env": { "RAPIDAPI_KEY": "your-rapidapi-key" }
    }
  }
}
```

Listings: `rapidapi.com/samaanmohammed` (email-verifier38, website-contact-extractor, linkedin-jobs-search1, youtube-data22).
